Approvals: Agent

Purpose:
  Defines agent escalation and approval workflow rules.
  Approval levels and matrix are defined in policies.sdd.

EscalationFlow:
  AUTO:
    Execute
  RETRY:
    Retry up to 3 times
  ALTERNATIVE:
    Try alternative approach
  HUMAN_REVIEW:
    Escalate to human

EscalationRules:
  [AP1]  After 3 failed attempts, agent MUST escalate to human.
  [AP2]  Production actions ALWAYS require explicit approval.
  [AP3]  Agent MUST NOT auto-approve actions with data loss risk.
  [AP4]  Agent MUST record approval decision in audit log.

State: +